# _headers = Security Headers Policy
#
# @summary
# Hardening headers applied to every response. The site has no backend,
# accounts, forms, or third-party code: every script, style, font, and image
# is self-hosted, and its links to the main site and the social platforms only
# navigate away. That lets the Content-Security-Policy be strict rather than
# needing broad allowances.
#
# default-src 'self' is the fallback every unlisted directive inherits, so
# connect-src, font-src, img-src, and manifest-src need no lines of their own.
# The directives listed either need a different value than 'self' (form-action,
# frame-src, object-src), are never covered by default-src at all (base-uri,
# frame-ancestors), or just state the default for clarity (script-src,
# style-src). style-src needs no 'unsafe-inline': the build ships no inline
# styles, and React sets its few dynamic styles (the app wrapper's and main
# element's layout, the menu items' stagger index, and the colors of each
# social card and the phone menu's social icons) through the DOM, which the
# policy doesn't restrict.
#
# Strict-Transport-Security keeps browsers on HTTPS for two years across
# every subdomain, leaving out preload, which commits the domain to the
# browsers' built-in HTTPS list and is slow to undo. Referrer-Policy is
# strict-origin-when-cross-origin rather than the siblings' same-origin: the
# user chose to let the main site and the social platforms see the visits
# this site sends them, so other sites receive this site's origin, never a
# page's full address. Permissions-Policy turns off every powerful browser
# feature the site never uses.
#
# @author z4nta0 <https://github.com/z4nta0>

# What: Security Headers Rule. Why: Every response should refuse framing, sniffing, plain HTTP, unused browser features, and anything loaded from another origin. How: This applies the Content-Security-Policy, the permissions and referrer policies, HSTS, a nosniff content type, and a deny on framing to every path.
/*
	Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; base-uri 'self'; form-action 'none'; frame-ancestors 'none'; frame-src 'none'; object-src 'none'; script-src 'self'; style-src 'self'
	Permissions-Policy: accelerometer=(), autoplay=(), browsing-topics=(), camera=(), display-capture=(), encrypted-media=(), fullscreen=(), geolocation=(), gyroscope=(), hid=(), idle-detection=(), magnetometer=(), microphone=(), midi=(), payment=(), picture-in-picture=(), publickey-credentials-get=(), screen-wake-lock=(), serial=(), usb=(), xr-spatial-tracking=()
	Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
	Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=63072000; includeSubDomains
	X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
	X-Frame-Options: DENY
